msgid ""
"The SBus input pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used"
" for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 "
"which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this"
" manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"SBus 输入引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于 ArduPilot 支持的所有接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 "
"除外，这两种协议需要真正的 UART 连接。但以这种方式连接时，FPort 仅提供 RC 信号而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-C3.rst:371
#: 2af1743a52bc48a693977cf79eb1b8f3 2eddf297495c4002a0f423e9d1e748a3
#: 4486fc050b0e48fd80622933ac50ae63 4f2e64dacee8486285980d731c953dd8
#: d89413d08fd64a3fa09a95dfb211cb0a f42ba132e3b240959218eba051522ec5
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL4 (UART8) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using UART4. "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""
"若要启用 Fport、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和嵌入式数传，需使用完整 UART（如 SERIAL4 即 "
"UART8）进行接收机连接。以下为使用 UART4 的配置。:ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为"
" 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-C3.rst:373
